  "description": "✨Charming East Perth Apartment – Elegant, Furnished & Central!<br/><br/>Positioned in one of Perth’s most sought-after locations, this East Perth apartment blends timeless elegance with modern comfort. From styled French doors and a manicured garden to two spacious courtyards and a character-rich brick façade — every detail whispers charm.<br/><br/>Step inside and you’ll find timber-style flooring and a fresh, airy interior that feels like your own peaceful retreat. Nestled in a serene, waterside village just 2 km from the heart of the city, this home is perfect for professionals or anyone who loves the perks of city living with a tranquil twist.<br/><br/>🏡 Features You'll Love:<br/>🛏️ 2 Bedrooms – Cozy and stylish<br/>🛁 1 Bathroom – Fresh and functional<br/>🛋️ Furnished – As pictured, ready to move in!<br/>🚗 Secure Parking Bay – Peace of mind for your car<br/>❄️ Air Conditioning – Stay cool year-round<br/>🚪 French Doors – Opening to a charming front courtyard<br/>🌿 Private Rear Courtyard – Your own outdoor escape<br/><br/>📍 Prime Location Highlights: Just 2 km to Perth CBD<br/>🛍️ Close to Perth City shops & Trinity College<br/>🚌 Near Perth Bus Depot<br/>🚆 Easy access to Claisebrook & McIver Train Stations<br/><br/>📩 Important: Home Open & Application Process<br/>* Send an enquiry to receive home open notifications and application links<br/>* Applications accepted \"after viewing\" or \"without viewing\"<br/>* Applications subject to viewing after approval will not be accepted<br/>🔑 Enquire today to secure this fantastic rental!",
